{"id":"brutalist-studio","title":"Brutalist — Creative Studio","description":"Raw, loud and deliberately unpolished — thick black borders, hard offset shadows, huge uppercase type and inverted hover states. For studios and brands that refuse to be ignored.","tags":["brutalism","studio","landing-page"],"type":"code","link":null,"updated":"2026-10-11T18:25:55.329Z","docs":{"file":"design.md","raw":"---\ntitle: Brutalist — Creative Studio\ndescription: Raw, loud and deliberately unpolished — thick black borders, hard offset shadows, huge uppercase type and inverted hover states. For studios and brands that refuse to be ignored.\ntags: [brutalism, studio, landing-page]\norder: 2\n---\n\n# Brutalist — Creative Studio\n\nAnti-decoration on purpose: 3px black borders, hard `8px 8px 0 #000` shadows, Arial Black uppercase headlines, a scrolling marquee and hover states that invert instead of fade.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Ink | `#111` — borders, shadows, text |\n| Background | `#fffef5` paper white |\n| Accent | `#ffd400` hazard yellow (selection + hovers) |\n| Shadow | `8px 8px 0 #111` (no blur, ever) |\n| Type | Arial Black / system sans, uppercase, tight |\n\n## Layout\n\nMarquee strip → oversized studio statement → works grid (cards invert on hover) → manifesto list with numbered rows → brutal footer with giant wordmark.\n\n## Motion\n\nSteps instead of fades: reveals snap in, hover inverts instantly, the marquee never stops.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n","body":"\n# Brutalist — Creative Studio\n\nAnti-decoration on purpose: 3px black borders, hard `8px 8px 0 #000` shadows, Arial Black uppercase headlines, a scrolling marquee and hover states that invert instead of fade.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Ink | `#111` — borders, shadows, text |\n| Background | `#fffef5` paper white |\n| Accent | `#ffd400` hazard yellow (selection + hovers) |\n| Shadow | `8px 8px 0 #111` (no blur, ever) |\n| Type | Arial Black / system sans, uppercase, tight |\n\n## Layout\n\nMarquee strip → oversized studio statement → works grid (cards invert on hover) → manifesto list with numbered rows → brutal footer with giant wordmark.\n\n## Motion\n\nSteps instead of fades: reveals snap in, hover inverts instantly, the marquee never stops.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n"},"files":[{"path":"index.html","lang":"html","content":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>RAW STUDIO — Brutalist\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  :root { --ink: #111; --paper: #fffef5; --acid: #ffd400; }\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  ::selection { background: var(--acid); color: var(--ink); }\n  body { font-family: \"Arial Black\", \"Segoe UI\", Arial, sans-serif; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); }\n  a { color: inherit; }\n\n  .marquee { background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); overflow: hidden; border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ink); }\n  .marquee-track { display: inline-flex; white-space: nowrap; padding: 10px 0; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; animation: slide 18s linear infinite; }\n  @keyframes slide { to { transform: translateX(-50%); } }\n\n  .wrap { max-width: 1060px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; }\n  nav { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 18px 0; border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ink); }\n  .brand { font-size: 20px; text-decoration: none; }\n  .brand b { background: var(--acid); padding: 2px 8px; border: 3px solid var(--ink); box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 var(--ink); }\n  nav .menu { display: flex; gap: 14px; font-size: 12px; }\n  nav .menu a { text-decoration: none; padding: 6px 10px; border: 3px solid var(--ink); background: #fff; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--ink); }\n  nav .menu a:hover { background: var(--ink); color: var(--acid); box-shadow: none; transform: translate(4px, 4px); }\n\n  header { padding: 70px 0 60px; }\n  h1 { font-size: clamp(44px, 8.5vw, 96px); line-height: 0.95; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }\n  h1 .fill { color: var(--paper); -webkit-text-stroke: 3px var(--ink); }\n  .tag { display: inline-block; margin-top: 26px; font-size: 13px; text-transform: uppercase; background: var(--acid); border: 3px solid var(--ink); box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--ink); padding: 10px 16px; }\n\n  .works { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); border: 3px solid var(--ink); border-right: 0; }\n  .work { border-right: 3px solid var(--ink); padding: 26px 20px 30px; text-decoration: none; display: block; min-height: 190px; }\n  .work:hover { background: var(--ink); color: var(--acid); }\n  .work .idx { font-size: 12px; opacity: 0.7; }\n  .work h3 { font-size: 22px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 46px 0 6px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }\n  .work p { font-family: \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; }\n\n  .manifesto { padding: 60px 0; }\n  .row { display: flex; gap: 22px; align-items: baseline; padding: 16px 0; border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ink); font-size: clamp(18px, 3vw, 28px); text-transform: uppercase; }\n  .row .no { font-size: 13px; background: var(--acid); border: 3px solid var(--ink); padding: 2px 8px; flex: none; }\n  .row:hover { background: var(--acid); }\n\n  footer { border-top: 3px solid var(--ink); margin-top: 20px; }\n  footer .big { font-size: clamp(50px, 12vw, 150px); text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1; padding: 30px 0 10px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }\n  footer .meta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 0 0 26px; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; }\n\n  @media (max-width: 760px) { .works { grid-template-columns: 1fr; border-right: 3px solid var(--ink); } .work { border-right: 0; border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ink); } }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"marquee\">\u003cdiv class=\"marquee-track\">\u003cspan>★ RAW STUDIO ★ WE MAKE LOUD WEBSITES ★ NO TEMPLATES ★ NO MERCY ★&nbsp;\u003c/span>\u003cspan>★ RAW STUDIO ★ WE MAKE LOUD WEBSITES ★ NO TEMPLATES ★ NO MERCY ★&nbsp;\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"wrap\">\n    \u003cnav>\n      \u003ca class=\"brand\" href=\"#\">\u003cb>RAW\u003c/b> STUDIO\u003c/a>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"menu\">\u003ca href=\"#\">WORK\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"#\">ABOUT\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"#\">CONTACT\u003c/a>\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/nav>\n\n    \u003cheader>\n      \u003ch1>WE BUILD\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"fill\">LOUD\u003c/span>\u003cbr>WEBSITES\u003c/h1>\n      \u003cspan class=\"tag\">EST. 2019 · KUALA LUMPUR · NO TEMPLATES, NO MERCY\u003c/span>\n    \u003c/header>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"works\">\n      \u003ca class=\"work\" href=\"#\">\u003cdiv class=\"idx\">W.01\u003c/div>\u003ch3>MOSH PIT\u003cbr>RECORDS\u003c/h3>\u003cp>Identity / Web / 2026\u003c/p>\u003c/a>\n      \u003ca class=\"work\" href=\"#\">\u003cdiv class=\"idx\">W.02\u003c/div>\u003ch3>CONCRETE\u003cbr>COFFEE\u003c/h3>\u003cp>Packaging / Web / 2025\u003c/p>\u003c/a>\n      \u003ca class=\"work\" href=\"#\">\u003cdiv class=\"idx\">W.03\u003c/div>\u003ch3>ZINE\u003cbr>MACHINE\u003c/h3>\u003cp>Editorial / Print / 2025\u003c/p>\u003c/a>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"manifesto\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"row\">\u003cspan class=\"no\">R.1\u003c/span> WHITE SPACE IS NOT WASTED SPACE. FEAR IS.\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"row\">\u003cspan class=\"no\">R.2\u003c/span> IF EVERYONE LIKES IT, IT IS ALREADY BORING.\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"row\">\u003cspan class=\"no\">R.3\u003c/span> THE GRID IS A SUGGESTION, NOT A LAW.\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"row\">\u003cspan class=\"no\">R.4\u003c/span> SHIP IT LOUD. SHIP IT RAW.\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cfooter>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"wrap\">\n      \u003cd